  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.1 fix(sonar): pass CancellationToken and fix new-code issues (#1938)\n        v1.2.0 feat(velopack,cloudsync): scheduled update check, deferral store and forced update (#1681)\n        v1.1.0 feat(velopack,cloudsync): update apply gate, so an update waits for running syncs (#1679, #1680)\n        v1.0.0 fix(logging)!: log exception type names only, remove exception-taking templates (#1371)\n        v0.3.1 fix(logging): log exception type names only, never messages or instances (#1371)\n        v0.3.0 feat(localization): extract localisation service into AStarDev.Localization package\n        v0.3.0 feat(velopack-publishing): localized update dialog text provider backed by AStarDev.Localization\n        v0.2.0 feat(velopack-publishing): expose update check outcome\n        v0.1.0 feat(velopack): show download percentage and MB progress in the update dialog",
